{"title":"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two thousand points are given on a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circle\" title=\"Circle\">circle</a>. Label one of the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. From this point, count <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points in the clockwise direction and label this point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. From the point labeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, count <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points in the clockwise direction and label this point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. (See figure.) Continue this process until the labels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bcab3a66f4476200cf8748c80fabe3bca43c8e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3\\dots,1993\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> are all used. Some of the points on the circle will have more than one label and some points will not have a label. What is the smallest integer that labels the same point as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45fabf5c3fa51caa9ab513719e62d0bb8f95157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />? \n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_1993_Problem_9.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/3/39/AIME_1993_Problem_9.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"230\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The label <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45fabf5c3fa51caa9ab513719e62d0bb8f95157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> will occur on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e0da3f156a9e634e02c9f7e8b0ad30cfd7a66a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12(1993)(1994) \\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"211\" height=\"37\" />th point around the circle. (Starting from 1) A number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> will only occupy the same point on the circle if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcb12c74245b3f5b17b7bc4c53e0494cd66f67c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12(n)(n + 1)\\equiv \\frac12(1993)(1994) \\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"330\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>Simplifying this expression, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/7222a3332839bb370a7f6c44de1e5a7b812a5f26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1993)(1994) - (n)(n + 1) = (1993 - n)(1994 + n)\\equiv 0\\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"527\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51d0fc8ee4c6d4a5dd6f9c61c618595b77d8d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993 - n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4f168342ea14cdc853704987195bed5475c725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994 + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> is odd, and each of them must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51d0fc8ee4c6d4a5dd6f9c61c618595b77d8d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993 - n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4f168342ea14cdc853704987195bed5475c725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994 + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95ac561d9bedc75d60abc98b4e1de4e76a976a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\equiv 118 \\pmod {125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/6133386951351e702396bf8525661c6585396973.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 6 \\pmod {16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />. The smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for this case is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a006c697632ebcf73bf31ecf61afa52d9118fd14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$118$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>In order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51d0fc8ee4c6d4a5dd6f9c61c618595b77d8d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993 - n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" /> to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4f168342ea14cdc853704987195bed5475c725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994 + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12ece0058b2e73a18123d0c4503c5d26ec09af73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 9\\pmod{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60da7e7e2308ff53ff5292f64a5fa424a531e90f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 6\\pmod{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />. The smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for this case is larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a006c697632ebcf73bf31ecf61afa52d9118fd14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$118$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c851b8731ef9deac914acfd0c0e569472391ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{118}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> is our answer.\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> One can just substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/f/13f8c29fa0fccdbbcfb712a2b5c5abdccf04ccda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993\\equiv-7\\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d81ff4fd48a6ac45cdeb4e646147cf86201a99fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994\\equiv-6\\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" /> to simplify calculations.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two labels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> occur on the same point if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/a/dfa0b6bf11be8ecdf5b9bceebda5bc8792191e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ a(a+1)/2\\equiv \\ b(b+1)/2\\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"299\" height=\"20\" />. If we assume the final answer be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcb12c74245b3f5b17b7bc4c53e0494cd66f67c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12(n)(n + 1)\\equiv \\frac12(1993)(1994) \\pmod{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"330\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on both side we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/9/c49e360d9fd11d95823c9a6514560228dccb50d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1993)(1994) - (n)(n + 1) = (1993 - n)(1994 + n)\\equiv 0\\pmod{4000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"531\" height=\"20\" />. As they have different parities, the even one must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/1/95153bbe879d0025bb288fa0fc8ebb22da9fa2ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1993 - n)+(1994 + n)\\equiv 2\\pmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"297\" height=\"20\" />, one of them is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which indicates it's divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Which leads to four different cases: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f055e1691ba929802309cf86b05b5e211bf6995e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993-n\\equiv 0\\pmod{4000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />&#160;; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a80fec8206c7d82341b5042a86d765886fb3b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994+n\\equiv 0\\pmod{4000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />&#160;; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4bd99878e032fda44bb55c0906e67f88d26e653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993-n\\equiv 0\\pmod{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b68f24ec92b54c50a03690d0ec5fae1d7d04083.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994+n\\equiv 0\\pmod{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" />&#160;; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9f42eeebab08a6739717113eb06c6593c5fcc0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993-n\\equiv 0\\pmod{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a195ce8de0cbf27a3b2f0e95c02d5c9c8efddb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994+n\\equiv 0\\pmod{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />. Which leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a2c7a36c644f83ef90e2cd233acca6df8e0395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\equiv 1993,2006,3881$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fa353819ba91c4976471586bf9721e7efd7843.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$118\\pmod{4000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> respectively, and only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee439d58f0bb3efbc1584fe7ca3c737d43937cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=118$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> satisfied.Therefore answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c851b8731ef9deac914acfd0c0e569472391ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{118}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.(by ZJY)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME\" title=\"1993 AIME\">1993 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1993 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180632\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 363/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1768/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 90/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10509/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.368      1 -total\n 59.70%    7.384      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.58%    4.771      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2939:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017180632 and revision id 198474. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}